      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the text, using the words given. You do not need to use all the words.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/exams/16520-2_cd7be113.jpg\" alt width=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 95.0715%; height: 84px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>hesitate</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>contribute</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>nomadic</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>annual</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>majestic</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.275%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>help</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>The Sahara Desert's <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-910453-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-910453-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910453-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;beauty, with its endless sand dunes stretching to the horizon, fascinates many travelers. Exploring this breathtaking travel destination often involves riding a camel, just as <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-910453-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-910453-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910453-1' /></span></strong>&nbsp;people have done for centuries. While the extreme climate might give some pause, those who visit can&#8217;t <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-910453-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-910453-2' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910453-2' /></span></strong>&nbsp;enjoying the vast, golden landscape. If you have the opportunity, don't <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-910453-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-910453-3' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910453-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;- it's a truly unforgettable experience.</p>",
