      "questionText": "<p><strong>Read the following text and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/exams/16520-4-min__1__075c83ea.jpg\" alt width=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Amazon Rainforest <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='0' name='fbo-910484-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-910484-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910484-0'></option><option value=\"charges\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-0-charges'>charges</option><option value=\"interrupts\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-0-interrupts'>interrupts</option><option value=\"possesses\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-0-possesses'>possesses</option><option value=\"consists\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-0-consists'>consists</option></select></span></strong> incredible biodiversity that makes it one of Earth's most valuable natural wonders. Protecting its unique ecosystems is essential, and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='1' name='fbo-910484-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-910484-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910484-1'></option><option value=\"culture\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-1-culture'>culture</option><option value=\"practice\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-1-practice'>practice</option><option value=\"access\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-1-access'>access</option><option value=\"property\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-1-property'>property</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;to some areas is restricted to reduce human impact. Environmental organizations play a crucial role in safeguarding the rainforest. They support initiatives to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='2' name='fbo-910484-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-910484-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910484-2'></option><option value=\"transmit\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-2-transmit'>transmit</option><option value=\"suggest\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-2-suggest'>suggest</option><option value=\"mention\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-2-mention'>mention</option><option value=\"conserve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-2-conserve'>conserve</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;its diverse wildlife and landscapes. They also promote the rainforest online and even offer <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='3' name='fbo-910484-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-910484-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910484-3'></option><option value=\"religious\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-3-religious'>religious</option><option value=\"personal\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-3-personal'>personal</option><option value=\"effortless\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-3-effortless'>effortless</option><option value=\"virtual\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910484-3-virtual'>virtual</option></select></span></strong> tours for those who want to explore from home.</p>",
